Amazing Places
</h5>


<p>
Explore unique stays worldwide.
</p>


</div>


</div>





<div class="col-md-4">


<div class="feature-card">


<h3>
🏡
</h3>


<h5>
Comfortable Homes
</h5>


<p>
Stay like your own home.
</p>


</div>


</div>





<div class="col-md-4">


<div class="feature-card">


<h3>
⭐
</h3>


<h5>
Trusted Reviews
</h5>


<p>
Real reviews from travellers.
</p>


</div>


</div>



</div>


</section>










<style>


.hero{


height:80vh;

background-image:url(
"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507525428034-b723cf961d3e"
);


